Experiment 11: Writing Unit Tests using JUnit in Jenkins
Aim

To write unit test cases using JUnit and execute them using Maven in Jenkins for automated testing.

Theory (Short)

JUnit is a Java testing framework used to write and run automated test cases.
Jenkins is a CI/CD tool that automates build and test execution.
Maven is used to manage dependencies and build the project.
JUnit tests are executed in Jenkins through a pipeline and test results are generated automatically.

