Step 8: Install Jenkins Plugins

Go to:

Manage Jenkins → Plugins

Install:

Git plugin
Maven plugin
Pipeline plugin
JUnit plugin

Restart Jenkins.

Step 9: Create Jenkins Pipeline

Create Jenkinsfile:

pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {

        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/username/lab11.git'
            }
        }

        stage('Build & Test') {
            steps {
                bat 'mvn clean test'
            }
        }
    }

    post {
        always {
            junit '**/target/surefire-reports/*.xml'
        }
    }
}
